#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.pivot_table.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.pivot_table"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.reshape.pivot_table.pivot_table:1 of
msgid "Create a spreadsheet-style pivot table as a LiteFrame."
msgstr "创建一个电子表格样式的数据透视表，返回 LiteFrame。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.reshape.pivot_table.pivot_table:3 of
msgid ""
"Aggregate ``data`` by ``index`` columns and spread ``columns`` values "
"into wide format.  The result is a flat LiteFrame — column names are "
"plain strings (no MultiIndex)."
msgstr ""
"按 ``index`` 列聚合 ``data``，并将 ``columns`` 的值展开为宽格式。结果是一个"
"扁平的 LiteFrame —— 列名为普通字符串（无 MultiIndex）。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.reshape.pivot_table.pivot_table of
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.reshape.pivot_table.pivot_table:7 of
msgid "Source LiteFrame."
msgstr "源 LiteFrame。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.reshape.pivot_table.pivot_table:9 of
msgid "Column(s) to aggregate.  If ``None``, all non-index/non-columns columns are aggregated."
msgstr "要聚合的列。如果为 ``None``，则聚合所有非 index、非 columns 的列。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.reshape.pivot_table.pivot_table:11 of
msgid ""
"Column(s) to group by on the pivot table index (rows).  At least one of "
"``index`` or ``columns`` must be specified."
msgstr ""
"用于数据透视表索引（行）的分组列。至少需要指定 ``index`` 或 ``columns`` "
"中的一个。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.reshape.pivot_table.pivot_table:13 of
msgid ""
"Column(s) whose distinct values become the new columns.  At least one of "
"``index`` or ``columns`` must be specified."
msgstr ""
"其不同值将成为新列的列。至少需要指定 ``index`` 或 ``columns`` 中的一个。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.reshape.pivot_table.pivot_table:15 of
msgid ""
"Aggregation function.  A string names a built-in reduction (``\"sum\"``, "
"``\"mean\"``, ``\"min\"``, ``\"max\"``, ``\"count\"``, ``\"median\"``, etc.)."
msgstr ""
"聚合函数。字符串指定内置聚合操作（``\"sum\"``、``\"mean\"``、``\"min\"``、"
"``\"max\"``、``\"count\"``、``\"median\"`` 等）。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.reshape.pivot_table.pivot_table:17 of
msgid "Value to replace missing values with in the resulting pivot table."
msgstr "用于替换结果数据透视表中缺失值的值。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.reshape.pivot_table.pivot_table:18 of
msgid "Do not include columns whose entries are all NaN."
msgstr "不包括所有条目均为 NaN 的列。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.reshape.pivot_table.pivot_table:19 of
msgid "Sort the result by the ``columns`` values."
msgstr "按 ``columns`` 的值对结果排序。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.reshape.pivot_table.pivot_table of
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.reshape.pivot_table.pivot_table:22 of
msgid ""
"Pivot table as a flat LiteFrame.  Index columns appear first, followed by "
"one column per distinct ``columns`` value."
msgstr ""
"数据透视表，返回扁平的 LiteFrame。索引列在前，其后是每个不同 ``columns`` "
"值对应的一列。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.reshape.pivot_table.pivot_table of
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.reshape.pivot_table.pivot_table:26 of
msgid ":py:obj:`pivot`"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.reshape.pivot_table.pivot_table:27 of
msgid "Reshape without aggregation (raises on duplicates)."
msgstr "不进行聚合的重塑操作（存在重复值时抛出异常）。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.reshape.pivot_table.pivot_table:29 of
msgid ":py:obj:`groupby`"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.reshape.pivot_table.pivot_table:30 of
msgid "Group-by aggregation without spreading columns."
msgstr "不展开列的分组聚合。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.reshape.pivot_table.pivot_table of
msgid "示例"
msgstr ""
